            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.12.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kwol 12:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Ekibuga kyange Sioni kiri ng'oti mukazi azaala ng'akaali kulumwaku naire! Ebisa byali bikaali na kumuluma, ng'azaala omwana mulenzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naani eyaali awuliireku ekintu ng'oti n'ekyo, era naani eyaali akiboineku? Ensi esobola okuzaalibwagho mu lunaku olulala luti? Eighanga lisobola okumerukagho mu kaseera obuseera? Aye Sioni yali yaakalumwa ati, ng'azaala abaana be. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulowooza muti nze ndituusa abantu bange mu kaseera ak'okuzaalibwa, aye naabalekayo mu nda, naaloba kubatuusa ku kuzaalibwa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe mwenamwena abagonza Yerusalemu, musangaalire ghalala naye, era musagambe ku lulwe. Imwe mwenamwena abalira ku lulwe era abamulumirwa, mweyimbe ghalala mu isanhu lye musagambe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "musobole okwonka mwigute amabeere ge agaidhwire, era mugabane ku kitiisa kye ekiswikiriire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Bona, ndireetera ebirungi okuba mu Yerusalemu ebingi einho, nga bikuuluula bukuuluule ng'oti mwiga. Obukombe obw'amaghanga buliyoolookera omwo ng'oti n'omwiga ogwidhwire ni gubanda n'okubanda. Era imwe mulirabirirwa ng'oti mwana mughere inhina y'ayonsa, n'amulera era n'amutenga ku mubiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndibaghemberera mu Yerusalemu ng'oti n'inhina w'omwana bw'aghemberera omwana we okumusirisaagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo mulikibona mwasagamba mu myoyo ni mu mibiri, mwairamu obulamu n'amaani. Era kirimanhikana nga nze Musengwa Katonda nhamba abagheereza bange abampulira, aye naasungughalira abazigu bange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bona, Musengwa Katonda aliidhira mu muliro ng'ali n'ebigaali eby'omu lutalo ebiziinhuuka ng'oti kiwunga, ng'aidha okwolesa obusungu bwe obubitirivu, n'okubonereza ng'akozesa enimi edh'omuliro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda alibonereza abantu boonaboona ng'akozesa muliro na mpiima, era abo b'aliita baliba kamaala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda akoba ati: “Abo abeerongoosa ni beetukuza, era ni basimba enhiriri okuja ku mikolo egiba mu nimiro dhe basengamu emisambwa, ni balya emamba y'embiidhi, n'empube, n'ebyenhinhalwa ebindi, balizikirizibwa boonaboona ghalala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nze ndidhi bye bakola ni bye balowooza. Ekiseera kiidha kutuuka nsoloze ab'amaghanga goonagoona aboogera enimi edha buli nsambo. Baliidha baabona ekitiisa kyange, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "era naakola akamanhiso nga babona. Abo abaliwonagho ku abo, ndibatuma mu maghanga ni mu biketezo eby'oku nhandha eby'eghala ye batampulirangaku, waire okubona ku kitiisa kyange. Balija baalangirira ekitiisa kyange mu maghanga: e Tarushishi, e Puti, e Ludi eri abakugu mu kulasa obusaale, e Tubali, n'e Yavani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.66.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.66.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 66:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baliiza baganda baimwe boonaboona nga babatoola mu maghanga goonagoona, baabaleeta ng'ekigheebwayo eri nze Musengwa Katonda, ku lusozi lwange olutukuvu Yerusalemu. Balibaleetera ku mbalaasi, ku nhumbu, ku ngamiya, ku bigaali eby'omu lutalo, ni ku bigaali ebindi, ng'oti n'Abaisiraeli bwe baleeta ebigheebwayo eby'emere ey'empeke mu isinzizo nga babitaire mu bintu ebirongoofu ebireeterwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
